@startuml state-request
' CampusSwap - State diagram: the status of one swap request
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFF0F2
  BorderColor #FF385C
  ArrowColor #475569
  FontStyle bold
  AttributeFontStyle plain
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF7EB
  BorderColor #FFA114
}

state "open" as Open : in the matching pool
state "matched" as Matched : placed in a proposed swap chain;\nwaiting for every member to answer
state "completed" as Completed : warden approved;\nstudent moved to the new seat
state "withdrawn" as Withdrawn : closed; the student keeps\ntheir current room

[*] --> Open : student submits a valid\nranked list (tracking ID given)
Open --> Open : round runs but the student\nis not placed in a chain
Open --> Withdrawn : student withdraws
Open --> Matched : a saved TTC round places\nthe student in a chain
Matched --> Open : chain dissolved: another member\ndeclined, or the deadline passed\nafter this student accepted
Matched --> Withdrawn : chain dissolved: this student\ndeclined, or did not answer\nwithin 48 hours
Matched --> Completed : warden approves\nthe confirmed chain
Completed --> [*]
Withdrawn --> [*]

note bottom of Matched
  A matched request cannot be withdrawn
  (error code in_cycle). The student
  declines the chain instead.
end note
@enduml
